case: shutting-down (source mode SHUTTING_DOWN)

The half of the startup/shutdown pair the contract DOES declare.

Paired with `starting` on purpose: side by side, the two goldens show one
source vocabulary meeting an asymmetric target vocabulary, and show the
mapping handling the asymmetry by saying less rather than by inventing a
value.

Also pins the open question the 2026-08-15 fix deliberately left open --
whether a shutting-down sensor is meaningfully FUNCTIONAL_MODE_ACTIVE.
The golden records today's answer without endorsing it; changing it is
now a visible diff rather than a silent drift.
